        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Feel what it's truly like to be alone in the dark with this low-res, high-suspense point-and-click horror adventure.\nSet in Victorian England, when Jeremiah Devitt receives a letter from his old schoolmate Anthony Beechworth with a hidden, cryptic message, he knows something is wrong. His journey to an abandoned manor is only the beginning as he starts to remember a long-buried secret from his youth, discovering things man was not meant to know, and opening doors that should have remained closed…",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Siente lo que realmente significa estar solo en la oscuridad con esta aventura gráfica de terror point-and-click, de baja resolución y alta tensión.\nAmbientada en la Inglaterra victoriana, cuando Jeremiah Devitt recibe una carta de su antiguo compañero de escuela Anthony Beechworth con un mensaje oculto y críptico, sabe que algo anda mal. Su viaje a una mansión abandonada es solo el comienzo: empieza a recordar un secreto enterrado desde su juventud, descubre cosas que el hombre no debía conocer y abre puertas que debían permanecer cerradas…",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
